onfirm whether `payments-api` recovers on its own. If it doesn't, decide separately whether it needs a rollback.\n- The v3.4.0 release needs investigation before it's redeployed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011hrka1miDTz6LwDFbC4YiZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HgW1uy7UikX6kj83GUjfJc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized, so I'll try likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HPoRHHyGw9WLX1jnq9PKZ9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UZVa1hFZbLw3uP2AsYd1ZT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0133AeDAcruwYBqLvXg7uToE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01U8LEQHogzS1ZzJSTPDBz6m", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015uzTWoc3W35G2t6BGBykGU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The payments service is `payments-api`. It's on v5.1.0, which 